2026-07-27T12:27:21.5491637Z i /tmp/Rtmpa0NVX3/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:27:21.5491949Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:27:21.5492314Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:27:21.5492855Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:27:21.5493364Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:27:21.5494046Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:27:21.5494936Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
